# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact form delivery
#
# The business has no domain yet, so the form posts to Web3Forms, which
# delivers straight to the Gmail inbox with no DNS setup.
#
# 1. Sign up at https://web3forms.com with progressivedrivingschoolllc@gmail.com
# 2. Paste the access key below and into the Vercel project's env vars.
#
# This key is safe in client-side code - that is how Web3Forms is designed.
# The form does not work until it is set.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Once the business has a domain, switch to Resend for a branded sender.
# Verify the domain in Resend first (it will give you SPF/DKIM records), then
# set all three of these and redeploy. No code changes needed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_TRANSPORT=resend
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=website@yourdomain.com

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Set to 1 on a Vercel PREVIEW deployment to build the Somali pages before
# they are published, so the translation can be reviewed in place.
# Never set this in production.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PREVIEW_ALL_LOCALES=1
